  ('5d848878-b7ff-417a-b90b-fb679a2520aa', 'B', 'reversed_relationship', 'confuses the reduced species (oxidizing agent) with the reducing agent'),
  ('5d848878-b7ff-417a-b90b-fb679a2520aa', 'C', 'misconception', 'identifies the correct element but treats a product as the agent'),
